		"source": "DS10314 Rev 8 (STM32F411xC/xE): run 100 MHz from flash, external clock, PLL on, all peripherals disabled 11.6 mA typ (20.7 mA all enabled), VDD 3.6 V, 25 °C (Table 23); Stop with flash in Stop mode and the low-power regulator 43.1 µA typ (14 µA with flash in deep power-down, if the core sets it: not checked) (Table 28). No minimum supply current stated; 100 mA is Bringup's margin"
